steps.text:
Chain several conditions with `else if`. C checks them top to bottom and runs **only the first** one that's true.

```c
if (score >= 90) {
    printf("A\n");
} else if (score >= 80) {
    printf("B\n");
} else {
    printf("C or lower\n");
}
```

